WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:05.050
- [Margherita] Getting your
hair styled or your makeup done,

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.780
if you're a woman in Kabul,

00:00:06.780 --> 00:00:10.818
it's still possible even
with the Taliban in power.

00:00:10.818 --> 00:00:14.735
(speaking in foreign language)

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:19.940
- When the Taliban took over the country

00:00:19.940 --> 00:00:21.900
in August, beauty salons,

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.300
such as the ones you see
behind me, shut down.

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.130
Many of the owners of beauty
salons decided to erase

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.490
the images of women they
had on their windows

00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.670
to appease the Taliban,
to avoid retaliation.

00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:37.690
After a few weeks, however,

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:40.393
beauty salons started gradually reopening.

00:00:41.302 --> 00:00:45.219
(speaking in foreign Language)

00:00:50.221 --> 00:00:51.840
- [Margherita] And business is now slow

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:54.200
in this beauty center we visited.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:57.230
Still salons are pushing to stay open

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.353
and testing what they can get away with.

00:01:01.110 --> 00:01:04.500
In Kabul, many women are
scared of venturing outdoors

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:06.510
on their own these days.

00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:09.280
And those who do often
dress more conservatively

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:10.473
than in the past.

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:15.010
The Taliban have a more
moderate stance on women

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:18.340
than when they were last
in power in the 1990s.

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:20.880
But they have imposed some restrictions,

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.950
barring most female civil
servants from going to work

00:01:23.950 --> 00:01:27.703
and cracking down on protesters
marching for women's rights.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:33.750
Younger girls have been allowed
to go to elementary school.

00:01:33.750 --> 00:01:36.460
Though most middle and
high schools remain shut

00:01:36.460 --> 00:01:37.513
for the time being.

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:41.820
Keen to obtain international
recognition and aid,

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.850
the Taliban government has promised

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:47.470
to respect women's rights
within the limits of Islam,

00:01:47.470 --> 00:01:49.749
but many remain skeptical.

00:01:49.749 --> 00:01:53.666
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:03.771 --> 00:02:06.700
- [Margherita] 25 year
old Aqila Azimi who runs

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:09.140
a beauty salon in Kabul says she decided

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:12.713
to reopen and continue working
despite the potential risks.

00:02:13.846 --> 00:02:17.763
(speaking in foreign language)

00:02:37.364 --> 00:02:40.530
Asked about beauty salons,
a Taliban spokesman

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:44.040
told us that under their
rule, women will be allowed

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.970
to get an education and work.

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:50.130
So far there's no
indication that these shops

00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:52.023
will be forced to shut down.

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:55.880
Still Aqila's business is struggling.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:03:00.470
She says she's making
just around $110 a month

00:03:00.470 --> 00:03:04.438
down from $2,700 a year ago.

00:03:04.438 --> 00:03:08.355
(speaking in foreign language)

00:03:28.599 --> 00:03:31.250
- The last time they were
in power in the 1990s,

00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:34.593
the Taliban imposed harsh,
strict social rules on women.

00:03:35.513 --> 00:03:39.200
Women were barred from education and work

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.550
and could only appear in
public if they were covered

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.030
from head to toe,

00:03:43.030 --> 00:03:45.383
they had to be accompanied
by a male guardian.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:47.810
This time around,

00:03:47.810 --> 00:03:52.510
the Taliban haven't yet imposed
such strict social rules.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.360
The new government is
still working to formalize

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.373
those kinds of regulations.

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:01.950
Beauty parlors were also banned
when the Taliban last ruled

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.400
and business owners like Aqila
are worried that those harsh

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:07.971
restrictions could be reimposed.

00:04:07.971 --> 00:04:11.888
(speaking in foreign language)

